🚚 Explore. Deliver. Earn. Grow. Build your trucking dream in Truck Simulator Arizona!

Climb into the cab and experience the full trucker life in VR. Explore a huge world inspired by Arizona, from long desert highways and major cities to scenic routes, changing weather, and unexpected road situations.
{2940438059635043}
Start with a single truck, take delivery jobs, earn money, and turn your small business into a growing transport company. Expand your HQ, buy new trucks, hire drivers, unlock new licenses, discover new regions, and take on bigger jobs as your company grows.

Make your truck truly yours with 350+ customization items. Choose from 6 American and European trucks, personalize their look, and experience different handling and driving characteristics behind the wheel.
{1395434862073874}
Trucking is more than just driving. Refuel, wash, service, and repair your truck, interact with the cockpit, haul challenging cargo, and enjoy radio and audio channels during long journeys.

Explore 12 regions across 3 different biomes, enjoy realistic driving physics, and discover 25+ hours of trucking adventures filled with progression, relaxing road trips, and new challenges.

🔥 Start your engine, build your fleet, and become a legend of the Arizona highways!


